# Settings > Date & Time > Time zone on a system without timedated (and without zoneinfo files): the zone cannot be read
# (the row says Unknown), the list cannot be loaded (red status line "Time zone list unavailable", only UTC is offered),
# and a change fails with its reason; nothing else breaks and Esc leaves as usual. Review only: no golden.
# Fixtures: `tz none`, `tzlist off`, `tzset fail` (src/harness_stubs.cpp).
title settings native time zone without timedated
review
sizes 480x320 640x480
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-10-10
wifi 70
bt on
ntp off
tz none
tzlist off
tzset fail
home
header home
launch Settings
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
# Info, Network Time, Set Manually, Time zone: Up from Info wraps to Time zone
key UP
wait 300
shot tzm_row
header tzm_row "Settings > Date & Time" "Date & Time" Time
key ENTER
wait 1200
shot tzm_regions
# UTC, the only entry: the change fails, the reason stays in the status line
key ENTER
wait 900
shot tzm_failed
key ESC
wait 300
shot tzm_back
